{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Tower! Build! Build!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face mysterious enemies and clash with supreme bosses \u2013 prove you're the ultimate commander! Build powerful towers, trigger synergies, and equip them wisely to achieve victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Epic of Towers and Skills</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 mighty Realms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 unique towers, each with their own skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 40 powerful synergies that unlock strategic combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower power is ranked by Tier: Bronze \u2013 Silver \u2013 Gold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and utilize over 100 items to execute your strategy.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Choice, Your Strategy</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty levels and game modes to conquer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless waves of escalating challenges to test your leadership.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and build synergistic towers from scratch to gain the upper hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate and coordinate with teammates to perfect your defense.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Team Up for Victory</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade</strong>: Support teammates by sharing resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower Sharing</strong>: Complete your team's formation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item Storage</strong>: Share and retrieve ideal equipment for your towers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Positioning</strong>: Be the anchor your team can rely on.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game History</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroic Aegiso: Origins</strong> is a remake of the legendary Warcraft III mod, <i>Heroic Origins: Galaxy</i>. Continuously upgraded and rebalanced through many seasons, the game now returns with a brand-new, refined experience.<br>If you love strategy, tower defense, and cooperative gameplay \u2014 <strong>Heroic Aegiso: Origins</strong> is the perfect battlefield to put your skills to the test!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Battle Ready","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3675930/1bf281f6c8a6c153f08faf585b4aa8ec3cfdca35.jpg"},{"name":"Glory Across Realms","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3675930/ba75db2b70e55b72b42421669075c9881308a400.jpg"},{"name":"Call of Strategy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3675930/653124d4a26de60398998685a168fdc4ad717ab4.jpg"},{"name":"Tactician Mastery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3675930/04f278cca8fec0b99486a8b2336d12a75c33ad0e.jpg"},{"name":"Commanding Majesty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3675930/a0fd6bb02f51c536e97f88dd421a646fd00c392d.jpg"},{"name":"End the One-eyed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3675930/8e9f1dbc32c8e21d65007a290d9bd8a76bfbfbb0.jpg"},{"name":"Swift Execution","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3675930/a11581c480349113e4471ddcf9dbdf7ce43b6eb6.jpg"},{"name":"Battle Steed Awakening I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3675930/45da00273308ab580de0024eb037814c2c185b22.jpg"},{"name":"Supreme Commander I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3675930/ee3108bfac5ec65e0c498732a10fda65795b66ed.jpg"},{"name":"Destined Emperor I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3675930/f786bfe7ef8f2710c9a97cc37cc1b51